<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Account Approved - VessM</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0056b3;
            --primary-light: #e6f3ff;
            --primary-dark: #003d7a;
            --gray-light: #f4f6f8;
            --gray-medium: #e0e0e0;
            --gray-dark: #555555;
            --text-dark: #333333;
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --success: #2e8540;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f7f9fc;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .header {
            background-color: var(--success);
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .logo img {
            max-height: 60px;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .greeting {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--text-light) !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .button:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-dark);
        }
        
        .info-box {
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        .info-box p {
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background-color: var(--gray-light);
            color: var(--gray-dark);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .footer a {
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: var(--gray-medium);
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        p {
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-container {
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            
            .content {
                padding: 25px 15px;
            }
            
            .button {
                padding: 12px 20px;
                font-size: 15px;
                display: block;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">
                <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dcf4czeat/image/upload/v1742806425/virtual_1_maagcr.png" alt="VessM Logo">
            </div>
            <h1>Account Approved!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2 class="greeting">Hello, {{name}}!</h2>
            
            <p>Great news! Your vendor account for <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> on the VessM platform has been approved by our administrators.</p>
            
            <p>You can now log in to your account and start accepting service requests from maritime clients.</p>
            
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{loginLink}}" class="button">Log In Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <p>As an approved vendor, you now have access to all platform features, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>View and respond to repair job requests</li>
                    <li>Submit service reports</li>
                    <li>Manage your service history</li>
                    <li>Update your company profile</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p>If you have any questions about using the platform, please refer to our vendor guide or contact our support team.</p>
            
            <div class="divider"></div>
            
            <p>Thank you for joining our network of maritime service providers!</p>
            <p>The VessM Team</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>